        "Id1": {
            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument, established in the year 2000, is located in the state of Pennsylvania, in a place called Adams County. Adams County, Pennsylvania has Carroll County, Maryland to its southeast and Cumberland county, Pennsylvania to its north. The monument is categorized as a Contributing Property."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "A monument to the 11th Mississippi Infantry was erected in 2000 in Adams County, Pennsylvania, which has Carroll County Maryland to the southeast and Pennsylvania's Cumberland County to the north. The monument is categorised as a contributing property."
